  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #ACA8EA; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 4</div>
  <div style="flex: 1; text-align: center; background-color: #4C42CF; color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 4px; border-radius: 6px;">Section 5</div>
